  "上丘・下丘と外側・内側膝状体の対応":"Relationship of the superior and inferior colliculi to the lateral and medial geniculate bodies",
  "海馬から中隔野・乳頭体方向へ弧を描く線維路の模式です。":"A schematic fibre pathway arching from the hippocampus toward the septal region and mammillary bodies.",
  "海馬傍回":"Parahippocampal gyrus",
  "側脳室腔は同一0.5 mm格子の教育用ラベル、尾状核・視床・海馬は手動分節です。脳弓・モンロー孔・薄い脳室壁は独立分節できていないため、全境界を正解形状として扱わないでください。":"The lateral ventricular cavity is an educational label on the same 0.5 mm grid; the caudate nucleus, thalamus, and hippocampus are manually segmented. The fornix, interventricular foramen, and thin ventricular walls are not independently segmented, so do not treat every boundary as ground truth.",
  "間脳の視床下域にあり、視床の腹側・黒質の背側にある小さな核はどれですか？":"Which small nucleus lies in the subthalamus of the diencephalon, ventral to the thalamus and dorsal to the substantia nigra?",
