  "色で示された側坐核の位置関係として最も適切なのはどれですか？":"Which statement best describes the position of the nucleus accumbens shown in colour?",
  "側坐核":"Nucleus accumbens",
  "側坐核は腹側線条体の一部で、報酬や動機づけに関わる回路へ参加します。":"The nucleus accumbens is part of the ventral striatum and participates in circuits related to reward and motivation.",
  "被蓋と大脳脚の間に沿う帯状の核です。":"A band-like nucleus running between the tegmentum and cerebral peduncle.",
  "被殻・淡蒼球外節・内節の層状配列":"Layered arrangement of the putamen, GPe, and GPi",
  "後脳の髄液腔で、中脳水道からくも膜下腔へ至る髄液循環の通路です。":"A hindbrain CSF cavity forming part of the route from the cerebral aqueduct to the subarachnoid space.",
  "正中背側寄りの中脳水道":"Cerebral aqueduct near the dorsal midline",
  "赤核は中脳被蓋の核で、運動調節系と関係します。":"The red nucleus is a midbrain tegmental nucleus associated with motor-control systems.",
  "中脳":"Midbrain",
  "中脳蓋の背側にある一対の隆起です。下面正面からは隠れるため、モデルを回転して背側から確認します。":"A paired elevation on the dorsal tectum of the midbrain. It is hidden in the initial inferior view, so rotate the model and examine it dorsally.",
  "中脳蓋上部にある一対の隆起の位置です。":"The position of a paired elevation in the superior midbrain tectum.",
  "中脳水道":"Cerebral aqueduct",
  "中脳水道の背側にある":"Located dorsal to the cerebral aqueduct",
  "中脳被蓋内に左右一対で現れる円形の核です。":"A paired rounded nucleus in the midbrain tegmentum.",
  "中脳腹側で脚間窩を挟む左右の大脳脚の概略領域です。":"Approximate regions of the left and right cerebral peduncles flanking the interpeduncular fossa on the ventral midbrain.",
  "正中周囲だけを残し、脳梁の弧、側脳室、透明中隔、脳弓の上下関係を内側から見る標本です。側脳室を空間基準に、交連線維と辺縁系の出力路を分けて観察します。":"A specimen retaining only the perimedian region to show, from the medial side, the superior–inferior relationship of the corpus-callosum arch, lateral ventricle, septum pellucidum, and fornix. Use the lateral ventricle as a spatial reference to distinguish commissural fibres from a limbic output pathway.",
  "透明中隔":"Septum pellucidum",
  "透明中隔（位置目安）":"Septum pellucidum (positional guide)",
  "脳梁と脳弓の間の透明中隔":"Septum pellucidum between the corpus callosum and fornix",
  "外節の内側で内包に接し、淡蒼球から視床などへ向かう主要な出力部です。":"Medial to the GPe and adjoining the internal capsule, the GPi is a major output nucleus projecting from the globus pallidus toward targets including the thalamus.",
  "淡蒼球の内側区画です。大脳基底核から視床などへ向かう主要な出力部で、外節より小さく内包に接する位置を確認します。":"The GPi is the medial pallidal segment and a major basal-ganglia output nucleus projecting toward targets including the thalamus. Note that it is smaller than the GPe and adjoins the internal capsule.",
  "内包":"Internal capsule",
  "内包より上方で皮質へ扇状に広がる投射線維です。":"Projection fibres that fan toward the cortex superior to the internal capsule.",
  "IDs 23–29と33–35はCerebrA由来の教育用マスク、30–32は画像誘導の候補です。IDs 39–40の乳頭体はBigBrain水平連続切片から作成し、プロジェクト内確認を経て採用した教材用ラベルです。研究用の正解マスクではありません。":"IDs 23–29 and 33–35 are CerebrA-derived educational masks; IDs 30–32 are image-guided candidates. Mammillary-body IDs 39–40 were created from consecutive horizontal BigBrain sections and adopted as teaching labels after project review. They are not research ground-truth masks.",
  "この試作は既存の断面ラベル・模式補助・アトラス領域を由来別に表示します。新しいボクセル、メッシュ、線維束、結合、投射方向、興奮／抑制は追加していません。乳頭体ID39・40は専門家レビュー待ちです。":"This prototype displays existing sectional labels, schematic aids, and atlas regions with their provenance kept distinct. It adds no new voxels, meshes, fibre bundles, connections, projection directions, or excitatory/inhibitory claims. Mammillary-body IDs 39 and 40 await expert review.",
  "乳頭体ID39・40":"Mammillary bodies ID 39/40",
  "脳弓は模式3Dのみです。実標本の分節や断面ラベルは表示しません。":"The fornix is shown only as schematic 3D; no specimen-derived segmentation or sectional label is displayed.",
  "第三脳室と第四脳室を結ぶ正中の細い腔を、視認できる太さで示します。":"Shows the narrow midline cerebral aqueduct connecting the third and fourth ventricles at a visible thickness.",
  "第三脳室を正中の空間基準にして、左右の視床、その腹側に続く視床下部領域、さらに腹外側の間脳・視床下域にある視床下核を一つの切り出しで比較します。構造を外しながら上下・内外・前後の関係を組み立てます。":"Using the third ventricle as a midline spatial reference, this block compares the paired thalami, the hypothalamic region ventral to them, and the subthalamic nucleus in the ventrolateral diencephalic subthalamus. Remove structures to reconstruct superior–inferior, medial–lateral, and anterior–posterior relationships.",
  "知識ベースで作成した専門家未確認の模式脳室系3D。実標本由来ではない比較用表示":"Knowledge-based schematic 3D ventricular system without expert review; a comparison display not derived from an actual specimen",
  "脳梁は画像誘導の試作分節、側脳室は同一格子の試作分節です。脳弓は模式3D、透明中隔は位置目安であり、薄い膜や線維束の実測境界ではありません。脳弓柱・交連前後の詳細形態は今後の修正対象です。":"The corpus callosum is a provisional image-guided segmentation and the lateral ventricle a provisional segmentation on the same grid. The fornix is schematic 3D and the septum pellucidum a positional guide; neither represents measured boundaries of thin membranes or fibre bundles. Detailed morphology of the fornical columns and the region around the commissure remains subject to revision.",
